OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain, heavy at
OL,6,Ftimes, slowly clearing to the south
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,8,Fafternoon. Drier with bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells developing in the afternoon but
OL,10,Fwith showers possible in the west.
OL,11,FWinds easing in the morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying mostly dry in the
OL,14,Feast but showers in the west, which
OL,15,Fmay be heavy. Variable cloud with
OL,16,Fclear spells, especially in the east,
OL,17,Fleading to a chilly night here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
